{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/658466-lair-traits-and-atavisms","id":658466,"title":"Lair Traits and Atavisms","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-09-09T15:30:10-07:00","id":658466,"title":"Lair Traits and Atavisms","content":"Has anybody worked out some table or grid of which Lair Traits and Atavisms combine well together ? The game does provide suggestions to combine Lair Traits and Families, but I find this to be of limited utility since Beasts have ample leeway to customize their own Atavism arsenal. It seems Atavisms would often be a good guideline to pick Lair Traits and vice versa. I find no difficulty to pick Atavisms for a character concept but I feel rather more challenged with Lair features.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1949,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1949-irioth","user":"Irioth","date":". 09-09-2015, 06:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1949-irioth","name":"Irioth","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"566"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-11T04:51:06-07:00","id":660595,"title":"","content":"Well, not really sure what you mean by &quot;combine well together here.&quot; I mean, dragonfire and the fire-themed traits are a natural thematic fit, but there's no mechanical synergy really. I mean, you can rework the same exact Traits to represent everything from being in a digestive track to the bottom of the ocean to being in a cave in to being on the moon, so &quot;thematic&quot; association is up in the air as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum